# Report 030 (c-1), decision C8 P1: a backlight that is on / off only, found by detection ("backlight onoff": the Pi 5
# HyperPixel's gpio-backlight "backlight", max_brightness 1, no APPLAUNCH_BACKLIGHT in its profile). Screen > Brightness
# is the honest On / "Off 10 s" choice, as on the Pi 3A+ Luckfox, instead of 10 levels that all write 1. A release
# build. Review only: no golden.
title settings backlight onoff
review
sizes 800x480 640x480 720x720
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
backlight onoff
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Settings
wait 300
key ENTER
wait 300
expect_rows Brightness DarkTime
shot settings_backlight_onoff_screen
header settings_backlight_onoff_screen "Settings > Screen" Screen
key ENTER
wait 300
expect_rows On "Off 10 s"
shot settings_backlight_onoff_choice
